1. Replace all `commit('setActiveChat'...)` calls with `$storex.chats.setActiveChat(...)`
2. Ensure the `activeChat` state variable is **only** modified through mutations (`setActiveChat` and `clearActiveChat`)
3. Remove any direct state assignments to `state.activeChat` outside of mutations

